# Context hygiene for `docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile .`.
# BuildKit reads the ignore file named after the Dockerfile first
# (`<dockerfile>.dockerignore`) and falls back to the root `.dockerignore`.
# The Dockerfile copies explicit paths only, so this just keeps the uploaded
# context small (target/ alone is ~13 GB on a warm developer machine).
.git
target
**/target
web/node_modules
web/dist
data
.lkb
blobs
experiments
